 232            /
 233            /       THE PROGRAM MAY BE STARTED OR RESTARTED AT ANYTIME AT 0200.
 234            /       THE DATA FILE ON PAGE ZERO IS CLEARED, ALL FLAGS INITIALIZED,
 235            /       AND THE SR EXAMINED.  IF THE SR=0 THE DISPLAY UPDATE ROUTINES
 236            /       ARE SET TO PICK UP THE STATUS WORD FROM THE SR.  IF THE SR
 237            /       DOES NOT EQUAL ZERO, THE STATUS WORD IS READ FROM THE EIGHT
 238            /       CONTINGENCY INPUTS ON THE BLUE RIBBON CONNECTOR OF THE AX08
 239            /       (XR OPTION ONLY).  JUMP IS THEN TO THE DISPLAY
 240            /       FILE UPDATE TO START OFF THE GAME.
 241            /
