 340            /
 341            /       THIS IS THE INTERUPT SERVICE ROUTINE.  MOST OF THE
 342            /       INTERUPTS WILL BE FROM THE CRYSTAL CLOCK WHICH WILL BE
 343            /       COUNTED AND UNLESS THE COUNT OVERFLOWS THE INTERUPT IS
 344            /       DISMISSED IMMEDIATLY.  IF THE COUNT OVER FLOWS, JMP IS TO
 345            /       UPDATE WITH IOF.  
 346            /
 347            /       SPECIAL CASE IS KEYBOARD INTERUPT WHEN THE GAMOVR FLAG IS
 348            /       SET IN WHICH CASE THE GAME IS RESTARTED.  
 349            /
 350            /       UNEXPECTED INTERUPTS ARE COUNTED AND AFTER ENOUGH OF THEM
 351            /       HAPPEN THE PROGRAM HALTS.  IF THIS HAPPENS RELOAD OR FIND THE
 352            /       STRANGE FLAG
 353            /
 354            
