 359 00320 5324         JMP INTBUS              /NO TRY SOMETHING ELSE
 360 00321 2074         ISZ CLOCK               /AND BUMP CLOCK COUNTER
 361 00322 7000         NOP                             /IGNORE OVERFLOW
 362 00323 5253         JMP UPDATE              /YES, GO TO IT
