 539                    *600
 540            
 541 00600 1035 TWOUP,  TAD TWOFLG              /FIRST SEE IF IT'S IN NORMAL SPACE
 542 00601 7450         SNA
 543 00602 5210         JMP TWOOK               /YES, CONTINUE
 544 00603 7001         IAC                     /NO, BUMP COUNT AND TEST FOR REENTRY
 545 00604 7450         SNA
 546 00605 1045         TAD TWOFIN              /IF RE-ENTERING THROW BACK OUT IF FINISHED
 547 00606 3035         DCA TWOFLG              /AND CONTINUE
 548 00607 5750         JMP I IONEST
 549            
 550 00610 1033 TWOOK,  TAD TWOOUT              /HERE WHEN READY TO UPDATE IN NORMAL SPACE
 551 00611 7640         SZA CLA                 /IS IT EXPLODING?
 552 00612 5235         JMP TWOFIG              /YES DO NOT ALLOW HYPERSPACE
 553 00613 1032         TAD ONEFIN              /DID WE JUST WIN?
 554 00614 7640         SZA CLA
 555 00615 4754         JMS I TWOWN             /YES ENABLE END OF GAME MESSAGE
 556 00616 1073         TAD INTWRD              /TEST FOR HYPERSPACE REQUEST
 557 00617 0352         AND OP14
 558 00620 1353         TAD OM14                /BITS 8 AND 9 MUST BE SET
 559 00621 7650         SNA CLA
 560 00622 5475         JMP I HYPER             /8 AND 9 SET. ENTER HYPER ROUTINE WITH AC=0
 561                                            /FOR SHIP NUMBER 2
 562 00623 1073 TWOLEF, TAD INTWRD              /TEST FOR LEFT TURN - BIT 8
 563 00624 0116         AND P10
 564 00625 7650         SNA CLA
 565 00626 5231         JMP TWORYT              /NOT SET
 566 00627 7340         CLA CLL CMA             /SET, DECREMENT TWOTHE BY 1 DEGREE
 567 00630 5235         JMP TWOFIG              /SKIP TEST FOR RIGHT TURN
 568            
 569 00631 7307 TWORYT, CLA CLL IAC RTL         /TEST FOR RIGHT TURN - BIT 9
 570 00632 0073         AND INTWRD
 571 00633 7640         SZA CLA
 572 00634 7001         IAC                     /IF SET INCREMENT TWOTHE BY 1 DEGREE
 573            
 574 00635 1036 TWOFIG, TAD TWOTHE              /UPDTAE TWOTHE
 575 00636 4477         JMS I THEADJ            /BRING TO WITHIN LIMITS OF SINE,COSINE
 576 00637 3036         DCA TWOTHE              /AND STORE
 577 00640 1036         TAD TWOTHE
 578 00641 4465         JMS I SINE              /CALCULATE SINE AND COSINE FUNCTIONS
 579 00642 3043         DCA TWOSIN              /AND STORE IN DATA TABLE
 580 00643 1036         TAD TWOTHE
 581 00644 4466         JMS I COSINE
 582 00645 3044         DCA TWOCOS
 583 00646 1033         TAD TWOOUT              /DO NOT ALLOW VELOCITY CHANGE IF EXPLODING
 584 00647 7640         SZA CLA
 585 00650 5270         JMP TWOVEL
