 598 00661 1037         TAD TWOVEX              /ANGLE OF ORIENTATION
 599 00662 4500         JMS I VEESCL            /AND SCALE TO NOT EXCEED MAX
 600 00663 3037         DCA TWOVEX              /UPDATE Y COMPONENT WITH COSINE
