 612 00673 1041         TAD TWOPEX
 613 00674 3041         DCA TWOPEX
 614 00675 1040         TAD TWOVEY
 615 00676 4501         JMS I ISHFT
 616 00677 4501         JMS I ISHFT
 617 00700 1042         TAD TWOPEY
 618 00701 3042         DCA TWOPEY
 619 00702 1033         TAD TWOOUT
 620 00703 7640         SZA CLA
 621 00704 5750         JMP I IONEST
