 623            
 624            
 625 00705 1351 TWOLNC, TAD LNC2FG              /NOW CHECK FOR PROJECTILE LAUNCH. FIRST
 626 00706 7650         SNA CLA                 /TEST TO SEE IF RELOAD COMPLETE
