 628 00710 2351         ISZ LNC2FG              /NO, COUNT ONE CYCLE AND EXIT
 629 00711 5750         JMP I IONEST
 630 00712 7001         IAC                     /YES, TEST TRIGGER BIT 11
 631 00713 0073         AND INTWRD
 632 00714 7650         SNA CLA
 633 00715 5750         JMP I IONEST            /NOT SET, HELL WITH IT
