 641 00724 4470         JMS I RSHIFT            /FROM SINE OF ANGLE OF ORIENTATION
 642 00725 3416         DCA I AUTO16
 643 00726 1043         TAD TWOSIN              /SET INITIAL POSITION TO BE JUST AHEAD
 644 00727 7106         CLL RTL                 /OF THE SHIP
 645 00730 1041         TAD TWOPEX              /X COMPONENT
 646 00731 3416         DCA I AUTO16
 647 00732 1040         TAD TWOVEY              /NOW THE Y COMPONENTS FROM Y VELOCITY
 648 00733 4501         JMS I ISHFT             /Y POSITION AND COSINE
 649 00734 4470         JMS I RSHIFT
 650 00735 1044         TAD TWOCOS
 651 00736 4470         JMS I RSHIFT
 652 00737 3416         DCA I AUTO16
 653 00740 1044         TAD TWOCOS
 654 00741 7106         CLL RTL
 655 00742 1042         TAD TWOPEY
 656 00743 3416         DCA I AUTO16
 657 00744 1136         TAD M200
 658 00745 3351         DCA LNC2FG              /200 CYCLES OF RELOAD
 659 00746 4502         JMS I RESET1            /DRINK LEADEN DEATH, NUMBER ONE!
