 719            /       OF POINTS IS NOW DESCRIBED AROUND THIS CENTER USING THE
 720            /       MULTIPLES OF THE TRIG FUNCTIONS JUST CALCULATED
 721            /       SO THAT ANY POINT ON THE OUTLINE IS DESCRIBABLE AS X,Y
 722            /       DISPLACED BY X,Y OF THE SHIP ITSELF
 723            /
