1749            /
1750            /       THE FOLLOWING ARE THE SINE AND COSINE ROUTINES CUSTOMIZED
1751            /       FOR THIS PROGRAM FROM ANOTHER I WORKED ON.  CALL EITHER
1752            /       SINE OR COSINE WITH ANGLE IN DEGREES IN AC.  THE ARGUEMENT
1753            /       IS REDUCED THROUGH RECURSION UNTIL BETWEEN 0-89 DEGREES 
1754            /       AND THEN A TABLE LOOKUP DONE TO OBTAIN THE VALUE.  IT TAKES
1755            /       UP A FAIR AMOUNT OF SPACE BUT IT WORKS JUST FASTER
1756            /       THAN SHEEP.  THE COSINE CALL JUST TRANSFORMS THE ARGUEMENT 
1757            /       THROUGH SOME TRIGONOMETRIC GARBAGE AND CALLS THE SINE
1758            /       ROUTINE.  NOTE THAT CALLING EITHER ROUTINE WITH TOO 
1759            /       LARGE AN ARGUEMENT WILL CAUSE PUSHDOWN OVERFLOW AND THEN
1760            /       ALL HELL WILL BREAK LOOSE.  THE ORIGINAL ROUTINE FROM WHICH
1761            /       THIS WAS STOLEN HAD FULL WORD PRECISION.
1762            /
